[PART I-PRELIMINARY]

This Act may be cited as the Finance Act, 2016, and shall come into operation, or be deemed to have come into operation, as follows -

(a) Sections 2, 3, 5, 7, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 18, 19, 22, 23, 24, 25, 28, 29, 30, 31, 32, 34, 36, 54 and 67, on the 9th June, 2016;

(b)Sections 39(a) and 41, on the 19th January, 2016;

(c) Sections 16, 20, 21, 26, 29, 33 and 37, on the 1st July, 2016;

(d)All other sections on the 1st January, 2017
